.TH AVR\-TESTS 1 "" "avr 0.7.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-tests \- Read a job's tests, timings and recorded failure messages.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr tests
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read a job's tests, timings and recorded failure messages.
.PP
Use avr tests RUN_OR_JOB (or avr tests list RUN_OR_JOB). Accepts Avrea run/job IDs, GitHub run IDs and run or job URLs, and Avrea console run URLs. A single-job run is selected automatically. Use --job NAME to select one job from a run with several jobs.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
list
Read one job's latest confirmed execution, including repeated tests.
